  "qualification": "Unchecked retains the current1.13.16 baseline; Experimental improvements is the same unsaved candidate switch. Only valid same-owner/same-slot emissive histories may transition over150ms, with each static endpoint paired to its actual moving-caster snapshot when required and matching map/source metadata. Missing, partial, stale or incompatible history falls back to valid current shadowing. Slot reassignment, settings/epoch/zone changes abort retained history. Ranking/slot turnover remains current-only; a frozen moving silhouette can briefly trail or double during the fade. At most six logical transitions use lazily allocated history pools bounded to84MiB; no hardware or universal visual/FPS improvement is claimed. Qualified source-profile, native-culling and unchanged-buffer rotation limits inherited from1.13.17 remain.",
